00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.700
It is 35 minutes by car.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.890
You can see the full
directions on your phone.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.256
- Thanks Google.

00:05:49.256 --> 00:05:50.870
So there you have it guys.

00:05:50.870 --> 00:05:53.050
My morning routine is
about to come to and end.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:54.670
I'm ready to get to the hospital.

00:05:54.670 --> 00:05:56.200
Don't wanna be late,
because I have patients

00:05:56.200 --> 00:05:58.160
and I'm working til really late.

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.790
Now the last thing in my morning routine

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:01.320
is the drive into work,

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.980
and ever since I was a
kid, I loved sports cars

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.540
